-- DICT-SEMANTICS §6.2 T4 / R-SC3: `e`'s `Debug` and `Mappable` goals sit on
-- argument-position variables of a non-generalized member, which only a use could
-- ground.  None does, so at quiescence each is open with two or more instances, and
-- the binding is one `T-AMBIGUOUS-INSTANCE` on every verb, not an unrouted hole.
e = map debug

main = println "ok"
